# Example Trivy ignore file
# ----------------------------------------
# One finding ID per line. Optional expiration: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:2026-12-31
# Prefer fixing or upgrading over permanent ignores.
#
# Only add entries after review. Each line should include a short reason comment.
#
# Examples (commented out — enable only if needed):
#
# CVE-2023-12345  # example: transitive parser, no fixed release yet, not reachable in our path
# CVE-2024-00000 exp:2026-12-31  # example: accepted risk until next base-image bump
#
# GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz  # example: GitHub Security Advisory form also supported
#
# Keep this file small. Empty (or comment-only) means nothing is ignored.
